SUMMARY:River Assessment: A Short Hands-on Course
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\nCome and j
 oin the Conservancy and our local watershed ambassador\, Betsy Chernoff\, 
 for a short course on assessing streams\, specifically the West Branch of 
 the Rahway River in the South Mountain Reservation. Wear your rainboots or
  low waders if you want to hop in and help sample the not-so-deep waters a
 nd conduct a habitat and biological stream assessment. We will explore the
  ecological quality of the river\, in addition to water quality\, by colle
 cting macro-invertebrates\, aquatic insects. Our data will then be submitt
 ed to the EPA for review. Meet at the Boy Scout camping area off Cherry La
 ne. Go to the left (north) as you turn into Tulip Springs (see map). Looki
 ng forward to seeing you.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/somocon/events/315415186/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260625T174200Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260625T174200Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
